entries.behaviour:
ReactFlow prop `nodeTypes` (optional): NodeTypes. Documented default: {
input: InputNode,
default: DefaultNode,
output: OutputNode,
group: GroupNode
}. Setting it changes the observable flow behaviour described by its type (controlled value, handler, or option).

